        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras/1796789ef19052bf33a3d566aed432db.avif?t=1770454399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras_big/1796789ef19052bf33a3d566aed432db.webp?t=1770454399 width=1560 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「武均天下」现已开启战斗模式测试，预计测试周期30天。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >所有参与战斗测试的玩家，均可在游戏正式版中获得「三国创世卡包*5」+「测试先登」像框作为奖励！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>「官方共创交流QQ群」：947528876</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎加入我们，一起创造一款简单、有趣的逃杀桌游~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras/3263e90a0a391b1764c222918eb261ee.avif?t=1770454399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras_big/3263e90a0a391b1764c222918eb261ee.webp?t=1770454399 width=1560 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「武均天下」是一款多人集换式卡牌对战桌游，无需复杂的牌组构筑就能快速上手，回归卡牌桌游原初的乐趣与节奏感。在这里，你无需构筑牌组，就能像打扑克一样迅速上手，感受快节奏却深度策略的对战体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras/4321eefe5428f93c5dbcc24fe644e018.avif?t=1770454399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras_big/4321eefe5428f93c5dbcc24fe644e018.avif?t=1770454399 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>规则简单，轻松休闲</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无论你是忙碌之余寻求片刻放松的休闲玩家，还是打开电脑不知道玩什么的间歇性DZYW，在这里有策略、有惊喜、有博弈、有让人会心一笑的瞬间，每局都有不同体验！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras/5d61c347abcf6a560ad438df1b50a1cf.avif?t=1770454399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras_big/5d61c347abcf6a560ad438df1b50a1cf.avif?t=1770454399 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>非竞技，比赢更重要的玩在一起</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这不是竞技场，是故事发生的地方，我们相信，游戏不只是关于胜负，更是一种情感的共鸣。我们更看重的是人与人之间的情绪链接，<strong>这不是竞技场，而是一张让朋友、陌生人都能笑着说话的桌子。</strong>打牌只是形式，「武均天下」鼓励玩家<strong>一起玩、自由聊、轻松玩</strong>——比赢更重要的，是彼此之间的互动、故事与乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras/4c93fd9b068e023815ec1993056af18e.avif?t=1770454399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras_big/4c93fd9b068e023815ec1993056af18e.avif?t=1770454399 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>获得稀有卡牌，在集换中发现惊喜</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >稀有卡片定量发行，概率公开透明！通过对战获得灵晶去得到更稀有的卡牌吧！不只是力量，更是身份与荣耀！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >卡片不仅是游戏道具，更是玩家之间的社交方式通过「武均天下」的集换与交易机制，玩家可以自由交易稀有卡片。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras/e9797dd1f8c54b44e4247b4e4ee8c45c.avif?t=1770454399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855520/extras_big/e9797dd1f8c54b44e4247b4e4ee8c45c.avif?t=1770454399 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>没有最强卡，只有最合拍的你</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是敌亦是友，武将、装备与计谋、宝物搭配，让对战充满变数！</p>",
